<title>USA: Whittaker lending group waives compliance.</title>
<headline>Whittaker lending group waives compliance.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whittaker Corp Thursday said its bank lending group agreed to waive compliance of certain financial ratio covenants in the company's credit agreement until Feb. 28, 1997.</p>
<p>In a statement accompanying its fourth quarter financial results, the company said the waiver requires the company to pay additional fees and, in certain circumstances, additional interest.</p>
